# Chapter VII, the search for Arkt: Calisto's spell sends the player to the
# old Normaden outpost, on through the Mytrehen fortress and Spear Gorge to
# Arkt's temple, where the three faces of Arkt open the way into the Void.
# Position stands in for the walks and damage for the fights; ref FormIDs
# carry Arktwend's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from arkt_calisto
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# Calisto tells where Arkt fled, and his spell goes wrong.
case arkt_calisto
run
player->PositionCell -129 360 131 180 "Calisto's House"
talk CalistoHausCalisto02
ask Arkt's escape
choose 1
choose 3
choose 4
choose 5
choose 6
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_VII_SucheArkt == 1
end

# By the door the spell takes hold.
case arkt_spell
run
player->PositionCell -216 755 127 0 "Calisto's House"
until 3000 GetJournalIndex A_VII_SucheArkt == 2
end

# The Mytrehen fortress.
case arkt_mytrehen
run
player->Position 22512 -159600 3277 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VII_SucheArkt == 3
end

# Spear Gorge, on the way to the temple.
case arkt_gorge
run
player->Position -21004 -150600 857 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VII_ArktsTempel == 1
run
player->Position -34002 -147100 1060 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_VII_ArktsTempel == 2
end

# The three faces of Arkt fall; the ground gives way into the Void.
case arkt_faces
run
player->Position -37755 -162000 1329 0
until 300 "ArktsGesichter01"->GetDisabled == 0
# Their scripts bind seconds after they load; a death before that raises no
# OnDeath, so the fight lasts past the bind.
wait 900
console 05D99514.damageav health 100000
console 05C3EFC8.damageav health 100000
console 0579D972.damageav health 100000
button 0
until 600 GetPCCell "The Void" == 1
end
